OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786310307
OL,3,CCouncil defends checks into disgraced
OL,4,Cfuneral director who stockpiled bodies
OL,6,FHull City Council has defended its
OL,7,Fchecks into criminal undertaker Robert
OL,8,FBush despite criticisms over possible
OL,9,Fmissed opportunities to bring him to
OL,10,Fjustice.
OL,12,FBush stockpiled bodies at the Legacy
OL,13,Ffuneral home in Hull, while giving
OL,14,Fgrieving families - including mothers
OL,15,Fof miscarried babies - the wrong ashes.
OL,17,FThe 48-year-old was jailed for 20
OL,18,Fyears on Friday after admitting 67
OL,19,Fcounts of preventing a lawful and
OL,20,Fdecent burial, fraud and theft.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
