FL,338,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786310307
OL,3,CCouncil defends checks into disgraced
OL,4,Cfuneral director who stockpiled bodies
OL,6,FDuring the five-day hearing, Mr
OL,7,FJustice Hilliard KC raised serious
OL,8,Fconcerns that authorities could have
OL,9,Fcarried out more stringent checks into
OL,10,FBush.
OL,12,FEvidence submitted by both Hull and
OL,13,FEast Riding Councils said registrars
OL,14,Fwould follow up in cases where forms
OL,15,Fhad not been returned confirming a
OL,16,Fburial or cremation, prompting the
OL,17,Fjudge to remark families "will want to
OL,18,Fknow where they should be directing
OL,19,Ftheir anger".
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,338,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786310307
OL,3,CCouncil defends checks into disgraced
OL,4,Cfuneral director who stockpiled bodies
OL,6,FHull City Council leader Mike Ross has
OL,7,Fnow defended the authority, saying
OL,8,FBush ultimately "defrauded the council
OL,9,Fas well", while calling for systems to
OL,10,Fbe "brought into the 21st century".
OL,12,FSpeaking to ITV News, Cllr Ross said
OL,13,F"all processes were followed" when it
OL,14,Fcame to Bush, but were "not up to
OL,15,Fdate".
OL,17,FHe said: "It needs to be brought up to
OL,18,Fa 21st-century way of funeral practice
OL,19,Fso that actually these sort of things
OL,20,Fare made right.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,338,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786310307
OL,3,CCouncil defends checks into disgraced
OL,4,Cfuneral director who stockpiled bodies
OL,6,F"It's not fair on the families
OL,7,Faffected here, and it shouldn't be
OL,8,Fallowed to happen in the future."
OL,10,FUnder current protocol, green forms
OL,11,Fare filled out when a person dies and
OL,12,Freturned to local registrars to
OL,13,Fconfirm a body has been cremated or
OL,14,Fburied.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,338,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786310307
OL,3,CCouncil defends checks into disgraced
OL,4,Cfuneral director who stockpiled bodies
OL,6,FFollowing the judges' concerns, a
OL,7,Fjoint statement from both councils
OL,8,Fsaid registrars had followed up with
OL,9,FBush "multiple times" but received no
OL,10,Fresponse, saying the current setup was
OL,11,Fdesigned in "simpler" times and was no
OL,12,Flonger fit for modern purpose.
OL,14,FCllr Ross added the council "took
OL,15,Fappropriate action at the time".
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,338,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786310307
OL,3,CCouncil defends checks into disgraced
OL,4,Cfuneral director who stockpiled bodies
OL,6,F"There was a process put in place
OL,7,Fwhere he had to pay upfront before
OL,8,Ffunerals took place, for example, so
OL,9,Fthe council took the actions that were
OL,10,Fappropriate given the information that
OL,11,Fit had at the time.
OL,13,F"I think fundamentally it shows that
OL,14,Factually he was a man who was not
OL,15,Fdoing, as we've seen come to light,
OL,16,Fthe work.
OL,18,F"He was defrauding everybody, and that
OL,19,Fincluded the council, but obviously,
OL,20,Fthe victims of this terrible situation
OL,21,Fas well."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
