PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786310307
OL,3,CCouncil defends checks into disgraced
OL,4,Cfuneral director who stockpiled bodies
OL,6,FSome 35 bodies - including that of
OL,7,FJasmine Beverley's unborn son, Sunny -
OL,8,Fwere discovered at the Legacy premises
OL,9,Fon Hessle Road in March 2024.
OL,11,FThe court heard more than 200
OL,12,Ftestimonies from Bush's victims, some
OL,13,Fof whom had discovered that their
OL,14,Floved ones' ashes which they'd had
OL,15,Fscattered or turned into jewellery
OL,16,Fwere of a complete stranger.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
