OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,338,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786310307
OL,3,CCouncil defends checks into disgraced
OL,4,Cfuneral director who stockpiled bodies
OL,6,FCalls have since been made for tighter
OL,7,Fregulation into the funeral industry,
OL,8,Fwhere currently there is no legal
OL,9,Fmandate for scrutiny or inspections
OL,10,Finto funeral homes.
OL,12,FHealth Secretary Yvette Cooper told
OL,13,FITV on Wednesday: "There should be
OL,14,Fproper standards (funeral directors)
OL,15,Fhave to meet.
OL,17,F"There should be checks on those
OL,18,Fstandards and action you can take if
OL,19,Fthings go wrong.
OL,26,@vD@RpmvD@dpn
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,338,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33709
