CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786310307
OL,3,CCouncil defends checks into disgraced
OL,4,Cfuneral director who stockpiled bodies
OL,6,F"We have to have a full consultation
OL,7,Fon how we do that most effectively,
OL,8,Fand I am clear we need proper
OL,9,Fregulation of these services."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G9/9
